@startuml
title Restraints — Arch Flow

actor "Client\n(Frontend)" as Client
participant "API\n(restraints.py)" as API
participant "Filesystem\n(MEDIA_DIR)" as FS

== Match phase ==
Client -> API : GET /match?seat=driver&seat_belt=SLL
API -> FS : iterdir() scan files
API -> API : parse filename regex
API -> API : score matches (seat_belt + position + percentile)
API --> Client : {matched: true, video: {...}, score: N}

== Serve phase ==
Client -> API : GET /video/{filename}
API -> API : validate path (no '..', '/')
API -> FS : load file → FileResponse
API --> Client : stream video

note right of API
  VERIFIED AGAINST CURRENT SOURCE CODE
  Full match: _parse_video_filename, _score_match, path validation all correct.
  See SDD_sequence_restraints & SDD_DETAILED_VERIFICATION.md
end note

@enduml
